-- @description NKI Importer extension
-- @author Saxmand
-- @version 1.1.0
-- @about
--   # NKI Importer extension
--
--   Lets you drop Kontakt instruments (.nki) and multis (.nkm) on REAPER's arrange view (mixed
--   with other files too) and hands them to the "NKI Importer" scripts package, which does the
--   loading - install both. Restart REAPER after installing.
--
--   Source: NKI Importer/extension in this repository.
-- @provides
--   [darwin] reaper_nki_importer.dylib
--   [win64] reaper_nki_importer-x64.dll
-- @changelog
--   + Also catches dropped multis (.nkm)
